{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es el motor. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: si están lisas o gastadas de un lado, ya no frenan igual. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena el motor en mínimo. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.012, 0.478], ["qué", 0.491, 0.611], ["mira", 0.624, 0.93], ["un", 0.943, 1.05], ["mecánico", 1.063, 1.621], ["en", 1.635, 1.701], ["los", 1.714, 1.874], ["primeros", 1.887, 2.366], ["diez", 2.379, 2.579], ["segundos", 2.592, 3.084], ["que", 3.097, 3.204], ["llegas", 3.217, 3.643], ["al", 3.656, 3.789], ["taller?", 3.802, 4.254], ["No", 5.069, 5.354], ["es", 5.368, 5.531], ["el", 5.544, 5.653], ["motor.", 5.667, 6.183], ["Primero,", 7.137, 7.612], ["la", 7.9, 7.987], ["cadena:", 8.0, 8.45], ["si", 8.725, 8.862], ["cuelga", 8.875, 9.187], ["mucho,", 9.2, 9.6], ["ya", 9.875, 10.025], ["te", 10.037, 10.15], ["está", 10.162, 10.425], ["robando", 10.437, 10.862], ["fuerza.", 10.875, 11.375], ["Segundo,", 12.195, 12.795], ["las", 13.083, 13.258], ["llantas:", 13.27, 13.758], ["si", 13.995, 14.158], ["están", 14.17, 14.483], ["lisas", 14.495, 14.87], ["o", 14.883, 14.933], ["gastadas", 14.945, 15.445], ["de", 15.458, 15.545], ["un", 15.558, 15.695], ["lado,", 15.708, 16.008], ["ya", 16.27, 16.408], ["no", 16.42, 16.558], ["frenan", 16.57, 16.933], ["igual.", 16.945, 17.37], ["Tercero,", 18.216, 18.779], ["el", 19.041, 19.216], ["humo", 19.229, 19.429], ["del", 19.441, 19.591], ["escape:", 19.604, 20.066], ["si", 20.341, 20.479], ["sale", 20.491, 20.779], ["azul,", 20.791, 21.141], ["está", 21.454, 21.729], ["quemando", 21.741, 22.141], ["aceite.", 22.154, 22.641], ["Y", 23.273, 23.407], ["lo", 23.421, 23.555], ["último…", 23.569, 24.106], ["cómo", 24.793, 25.043], ["suena", 25.056, 25.343], ["el", 25.356, 25.431], ["motor", 25.443, 25.781